#==================================================================================
#
#   SCRIPT: CNA-DACS.ps1
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#   Single combined maintenance script for CNA-DACS servers.
#   Includes all operations — run from C:\DLA-failsafe\patching\
#
#   OPERATIONS:
#     1. Backup          - Stop services, compress CS directory, rotate backups, restart
#     2. System Center   - Stop services, backup, uninstall, reinstall agent, restore config, restart
#     3. Tomcat Upgrade  - Pre-flight, parallel deploy from NewVersion\, verify, rollback
#     S. Stage Software  - Copy this script + NewVersion\ to all servers via admin share
#     A. Run All         - Run operations 1, 2, 3 in sequence
#     Q. Quit
#
#   EXPECTED FOLDER LAYOUT:
#
#     C:\DLA-failsafe\patching\
#     ├── CNA-DACS.ps1         <- this file
#     ├── servers.txt          <- one FQDN per line; [Zone Name] headers optional
#     └── NewVersion\          <- new Tomcat build files staged here
#
#   STAGE operation copies to \\server\e$\DLA-failsafe\patching\ on each server:
#     - CNA-DACS.ps1
#     - NewVersion\  (full folder, overwrite)
#
#   REQUIREMENTS:
#     - PowerShell 5.1
#     - Run as Administrator
#     - Network access to patch.dacs.dla.mil (System Center agent download)
#     - Admin share access (\\server\e$) for Stage operation
#
#   CONNECTION FALLBACK ORDER (per server, per operation):
#     1. WinRM  (Invoke-Command, port 5985) — full scriptblock execution
#     2. DCOM   (CIM session, RPC port 135) — WMI queries + Win32_Process execution
#     3. UNC    (admin share \\server\e$)   — file read/write only (no remote execution)
#
#==================================================================================

